# The build context is the repo root, because the API spans four project folders.
# Send only those.
*
!OpenRestoApi/
!OpenRestoApi.Core/
!OpenRestoApi.Domain/
!OpenRestoApi.Infrastructure/
**/bin
**/obj
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
# Local overrides (Program.cs loads this file in every environment but Testing) can hold
# credentials; the COPY . . would otherwise bake them into the image.
**/appsettings.Local.json
